{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FAwbXL46c4M5vmYorg7SZg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Diagnose-then-Compress完整框架：CV诊断 + VTR通用压缩。\n  Claim 4升级为\"VTR provides universal compression across connector types\"——\n  pixel-shuffle从0%恢复到60%+，MLP projector在小M下也获益（VTC-only M=32 45%，M=64 52%，远超同压缩率hard pruning）。\n  L2-norm与random pruning在OpenVLA上全k-value一致（±3pp），确认MLP projector信息均匀分布，\n  跨模型公平比较无方法偏差。X-VLA seed44复现k=0.7 cliff在±6pp内，threshold-graded pattern稳健。\n  Analysis+Method双贡献均满强度，5模型taxonomy + 通用方法 = CoRL oral级别投稿。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C4-ext: OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep (核心假设 #1)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only（冻结LLM backbone，仅训练22M cross-attention compressor）在OpenVLA上\n      将256个MLP-projected tokens压缩至32 queries。验证VTR对MLP projector connector的通用性。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.45\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.407\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.494\n      total_episodes: 500\n      compression_ratio: 0.875\n      tokens_in: 256\n      tokens_out: 32\n      kv_cache_reduction_pct: 87.5\n      per_task_sr_range: [0.22, 0.68]\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector tokens已经是individually meaningful的（CV=0.215，中等异质性），\n      cross-attention compressor不需要解决pixel-shuffle的空间纠缠问题，而是执行信息选择与聚合。\n      32个learned queries通过cross-attention可以覆盖256个输入token的关键信息。\n      VTC-only冻结LLM避免了M=128 full VTR的灾难性过拟合（0% SR），\n      但LLM backbone期望256 tokens的attention pattern被压缩到32时存在分布偏移。\n      45% SR = baseline 74%的61%保留率，远超同压缩级别的hard pruning\n      （k=0.3 keep 77 tokens = 20.6%；VTC M=32仅32 tokens却达45%）。\n      7B LLM backbone的表达能力为适应压缩后的token提供了更大的鲁棒性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: VTR Cross-Connector Universality\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Connector | M | Compression | VTC-only SR | Hard Pruning (同压缩率) | Gain |\n          |-------|-----------|---|-------------|-------------|------------------------|------|\n          | SmolVLA | pixel-shuffle | 32 | 75% | 60.1±1.3% | 0% (k=0.5) | +60.1pp |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP | 32 | 87.5% | 45.0% | ~8% (k=0.125 est.) | +37pp |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP | 64 | 75% | 52.0% | 20.6% (k=0.3) | +31.4pp |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"OpenVLA VTC-only M-curve: x=M (32/64/96), y=SR%. 对比虚线=hard pruning at equivalent k. 展示VTR在所有压缩率下均优于hard pruning。\"\n    analysis: >\n      VTC M=32在OpenVLA上以仅32 tokens达到45% SR，而random pruning保留128 tokens（4×更多）\n      才达到37.4%。这证明learned re-encoding不仅修复pixel-shuffle纠缠，\n      对MLP projector也能实现更高效的信息压缩。Claim 4可升级为：\n      VTR provides universal token compression across connector types，\n      ceiling取决于connector的信息结构——pixel-shuffle获益最大（0%→60%），\n      MLP projector获益次之但仍显著优于hard pruning。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=64（75%压缩）在OpenVLA上的评估。与SmolVLA VTC M=32（同为75%压缩）形成跨connector对比。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.52\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.476\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.563\n      total_episodes: 500\n      compression_ratio: 0.75\n      tokens_in: 256\n      tokens_out: 64\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=64保留25%的token容量（64/256），压缩率与SmolVLA VTC M=32相同（75%）。\n      相比M=32，64个queries覆盖256个input tokens的信息更完整，\n      LLM的attention pattern从256→64的分布偏移也更温和。\n      52% = baseline的70%保留率，对比random pruning k=0.3（keep 77 tokens，20.6%）\n      和k=0.5（keep 128 tokens，37.4%），VTC M=64以更少tokens（64 vs 128）\n      超出14.6pp。M=32→M=64的+7pp增益符合信息论预期——\n      MLP tokens信息分布相对均匀（CV=0.215），更多queries = 更少信息丢失。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      跨connector对比：SmolVLA VTC M=32 75%压缩=60.1%，OpenVLA VTC M=64 75%压缩=52%。\n      SmolVLA更高是因为re-encoding修复了pixel-shuffle纠缠（本质是损坏修复），\n      OpenVLA则是纯信息压缩（tokens已经可用，压缩后部分信息不可避免丢失）。\n      这种差异恰好支持connector-dependent VTR ceiling的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=96 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=96（62.5%压缩）在OpenVLA上的评估。接近无压缩区间，测试VTR overhead。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.58\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.536\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.622\n      total_episodes: 500\n      compression_ratio: 0.625\n      tokens_in: 256\n      tokens_out: 96\n    result_rationale: >\n      96个queries保留37.5%的token容量。信息损失进一步降低，\n      LLM attention pattern的适应负担最小。58% = baseline的78%保留率。\n      对比SmolVLA M=96 VTC（54.5±3.2%），OpenVLA M=96 VTC略高，\n      因为MLP tokens本身信息结构更利于压缩（无空间纠缠需要修复）。\n      注意SmolVLA M=96存在统计确认的dip（p=0.034 vs M=64），\n      OpenVLA VTC-only可能不存在此现象——因为MLP tokens的均匀分布\n      使得M-curve更接近单调递增。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"OpenVLA VTC-only完整M-curve (M=32/64/96) + SmolVLA VTC M-curve叠加对比。展示两种connector的VTR效率特征差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA M-curve呈单调递增（38→52→58），而SmolVLA M-curve在M=96处有dip。\n      差异机制：SmolVLA re-encoding修复纠缠，M值影响不大（flat curve，所有M在±5pp内）；\n      OpenVLA re-encoding执行信息压缩，更多M=更多信息保留（monotonic）。\n      两种connector type展现不同的VTR机制，丰富Method贡献。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # D108: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning统一协议 (核心假设 #2)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm importance-based pruning（与X-VLA相同方法）在OpenVLA上k=0.95评估。\n      对比现有random pruning k=0.95=69.4%，验证pruning method不影响结论。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.68\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.638\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.719\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.95\n      tokens_kept: 243\n      tokens_removed: 13\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -1.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      仅移除13/256 tokens（5%），信息损失极小。L2-norm选择的\"least important\" tokens\n      与random选择几乎等价，因为MLP projector的3层GELU非线性混合使token L2 norms\n      分布相对均匀（CV=0.215）。在仅5%移除量下，无论哪13个token被移除，\n      剩余243个tokens的冗余足以补偿。68% vs random 69.4%的-1.4pp差异\n      在统计噪声范围内（500 episode的CI约±4pp）。\n      L2-norm可能略低是因为importance-based方法倾向于移除\"独特\"信息的tokens，\n      而random方法分散移除保留了更均匀的信息覆盖——但差异是noise-level。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: OpenVLA Pruning Method Comparison (L2-norm vs Random)\"\n        content: |\n          | k | Random SR | L2-norm SR | Δ (pp) | Within ±5pp? |\n          |---|-----------|------------|--------|--------------|\n          | 0.95 | 69.4% | 68.0% | -1.4 | ✓ |\n          | 0.90 | 62.0% | 60.0% | -2.0 | ✓ |\n          | 0.70 | 49.0% | 47.0% | -2.0 | ✓ |\n          | 0.50 | 37.4% | 35.5% | -1.9 | ✓ |\n          | 0.30 | 20.6% | 19.0% | -1.6 | ✓ |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"OpenVLA pruning curve overlay: x=k ratio, y=SR%. 实线=L2-norm, 虚线=random, shaded band=±5pp。两条曲线几乎完全重叠，证明pruning method对MLP projector无差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      L2-norm与random在所有5个k值上一致（最大差异2.0pp << 5pp threshold），\n      确认OpenVLA的3-layer MLP projector信息分布足够均匀，\n      importance-based vs random pruning不构成公平比较的偏差。\n      这消除了D108中识别的pruning method discrepancy问题：\n      paper可以放心地跨模型比较pruning curves，因为pruning方法不改变结论。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.9评估。对比random k=0.9=62.0%。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.60\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.557\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.642\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.9\n      tokens_kept: 230\n      tokens_removed: 26\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除26/256 tokens（10%）。MLP projector的moderate CV（0.215）意味着\n      L2-norm最低的26个tokens确实携带略少的信息，但由于非线性混合，\n      每个token的信息量差异不大。60% vs random 62%的-2pp差异\n      反映了importance-based方法移除的tokens之间存在轻微的信息互补性：\n      L2-norm最低的tokens恰好覆盖了一些独特的局部特征信息，\n      集中移除它们比随机分散移除造成略多的信息空洞。\n      但效应极小（-2pp），完全在±5pp阈值内。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9处L2-norm与random差异-2pp，与k=0.95的-1.4pp一致——\n      随着移除比例增加差异略微增大但始终在noise level。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.7评估。对比random k=0.7=49.0%。中等压缩率。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.47\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.427\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.513\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.7\n      tokens_kept: 179\n      tokens_removed: 77\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除30%的tokens（77个）。MLP projector的非线性混合在此压缩率下\n      导致每个被移除的token约贡献1/256的全局信息。L2-norm选择的77个lowest-importance tokens\n      总信息量与random选择的77个tokens接近（因CV=0.215的均匀性）。\n      -2pp差异源于importance-based方法的selection bias：\n      L2-norm lowest的tokens倾向于集中在特定spatial或semantic区域，\n      而random方法天然均匀采样。但MLP projector的spatial mixing限制了这种bias的影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA的cliff point（97.6%→56.2%），但OpenVLA在此处只是smooth degradation。\n      L2-norm 47% vs random 49%确认：graded degradation class对pruning method不敏感。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.5评估。对比random k=0.5=37.4%。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.355\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.314\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.398\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.5\n      tokens_kept: 128\n      tokens_removed: 128\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -1.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除50%的tokens。半数token被移除后，剩余128个tokens的信息完整性取决于\n      被移除tokens是否覆盖了不可替代的信息。对于MLP projector，\n      每层GELU非线性混合使相邻tokens共享约40-60%的信息（基于已知的attention entropy 0.639），\n      因此50%移除约损失25-30%的独特信息。\n      L2-norm 35.5% vs random 37.4%的差异维持在~2pp——\n      即使在高压缩率下，MLP projector的信息均匀性仍使两种方法等价。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.5是SmolVLA的全灭点（0%），OpenVLA仍保持35.5%（L2-norm）/37.4%（random）。\n      这个对比直接展示了connector type而非pruning method决定compressibility。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.3评估。对比random k=0.3=20.6%。极端压缩率。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.19\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.158\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.227\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.3\n      tokens_kept: 77\n      tokens_removed: 179\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -1.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除70%的tokens。仅保留77个tokens时信息损失严重但仍非零，\n      因为MLP projector的每个token都编码了全局信息的一部分。\n      19% vs random 20.6%的差异趋于收敛——在极端压缩率下，\n      无论选择哪些tokens保留，剩余信息量都接近一个下限。\n      L2-norm方法保留的77个highest-importance tokens与random 77个tokens\n      的信息覆盖度差异已被压缩到noise level（-1.6pp）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      5个k值完整L2-norm curve确认：OpenVLA (MLP projector) 的pruning行为\n      与pruning method无关（max |Δ| = 2.0pp << 5pp threshold）。\n      Paper可以统一报告Table 1的taxonomy，无需对pruning method加caveat。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # X-VLA seed replication (核心假设 #3)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA k=0.7 seed44 replication\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.7 L2-norm pruning的seed44复现评估。原seed42=56.2%。\n      验证threshold-graded cliff pattern的seed稳健性。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.52\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.476\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.563\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 44\n      k_ratio: 0.7\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -4.2\n      within_10pp_of_seed42: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA的cliff point——BART encoder的12层transformer mixing在此处\n      导致关键token依赖被打断。Cliff的精确位置受evaluation randomness影响：\n      不同seed意味着不同的episode初始状态和任务实例化。\n      原seed42的56.2%中，per-task SR极度不均（T1=2%, T4=28%, T8=0% vs T0=94%, T2=100%），\n      说明某些task处于cliff边缘。seed44可能将部分边缘task推向另一侧，\n      导致±5-8pp波动。52%落在[46, 66]范围内，\n      且cliff pattern本身（k=0.9 ~97% → k=0.7 ~52% → k=0.5 ~42%）的阶梯结构不变。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: X-VLA Pruning Seed Robustness\"\n        content: |\n          | k | seed42 SR | seed44 SR | Δ (pp) | Pattern |\n          |---|-----------|-----------|--------|---------|\n          | 0.9 | 97.6% | 96.0% | -1.6 | Immune ✓ |\n          | 0.7 | 56.2% | 52.0% | -4.2 | Cliff ✓ |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"X-VLA pruning curve with seed bars: x=k ratio, y=SR%. 两条曲线（seed42/44）在k≥0.9几乎重叠，k=0.7处分叉但均处于50-60%区间，确认cliff位置稳定。\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed44复现在±10pp内（52% vs 56.2%，Δ=-4.2pp），确认：\n      (1) k=0.7 cliff是BART encoder架构特性而非evaluation artifact；\n      (2) threshold-graded pattern稳健——任何seed下k=0.9→k=0.7的drop均为~40pp；\n      (3) CV=0.151正确预测了intermediate pruning behavior（k=0.7 SR ≈ OpenVLA k=0.7）。\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA k=0.9 seed44 replication\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.9 L2-norm pruning的seed44复现。原seed42=97.6%。确认above-cliff区间稳定。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.96\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.939\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.974\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 44\n      k_ratio: 0.9\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -1.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9保留90%的tokens，远在cliff（k=0.7）之上。\n      BART encoder的token依赖在仅10%移除时不会被破坏——\n      12层transformer的信息冗余足以补偿少量token缺失。\n      96% vs 97.6%的-1.6pp差异完全在evaluation noise范围内\n      （500 episode下baseline k=1.0 = 99.2%，本身就有±1-2pp波动）。\n      Above-cliff区间对seed极不敏感。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9 seed44=96% 确认threshold-graded model的\"robust zone\"跨seed稳定。\n      这与π0的immune behavior（所有k值均稳定）和SmolVLA的catastrophic cliff\n      （所有seed均0%）形成完美对比，三种pattern都是seed-robust的。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # OpenVLA random pruning seed replication (补充稳健性)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\"\n    plan_id: c3_mlp_projector_graceful_degradation\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7的seed43复现。原seed7=49.0%。验证graded degradation curve的seed稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.47\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.427\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.513\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 43\n      k_ratio: 0.7\n      pruning_method: random_true_removal\n      delta_vs_seed7_pp: -2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector的graded degradation是architecture-level property，\n      不依赖specific token selection（已由L2-norm ≈ random确认）。\n      seed43改变的是evaluation trajectory，不改变pruning pattern。\n      k=0.7保留179/256 tokens，MLP的3层GELU混合在此压缩率下\n      损失约30-35%的有效信息。47% vs 49%的-2pp差异\n      源于不同seed下task difficulty的微小变化\n      （per-task SR方差约±5-10pp为正常波动）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      seed43确认OpenVLA degradation curve的smooth monotonic pattern不受seed影响。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\"\n    plan_id: c3_mlp_projector_graceful_degradation\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5的seed43复现。原seed7=37.4%。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.36\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.319\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.403\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 43\n      k_ratio: 0.5\n      pruning_method: random_true_removal\n      delta_vs_seed7_pp: -1.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.5移除128/256 tokens。半数信息丢失后，MLP projector仍维持36%的SR，\n      因为保留的128个tokens通过3层MLP的非线性混合保有足够的全局表征。\n      36% vs 37.4%的差异（-1.4pp）小于CI宽度（~4pp），完全在noise内。\n      graded degradation pattern在不同seed下高度一致。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      两个seed的OpenVLA k=0.5数据（37.4%, 36%）可计算mean±std用于paper，\n      增强报告的统计可信度。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C5: Perceiver Resampler (bonus，可能不在deadline内完成)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo Perceiver Resampler baseline + pruning\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: >\n      RoboFlamingo（Perceiver Resampler connector）在LIBERO-Object上的baseline + pruning sweep。\n      添加第4种connector family（learnable cross-attention queries），扩展taxonomy。\n      注意：6天内完成fine-tune + 全sweep的可能性较低，属于bonus实验。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_sr: 0.42\n      k095_sr: 0.40\n      k09_sr: 0.36\n      k07_sr: 0.28\n      k05_sr: 0.15\n      k03_sr: 0.04\n      importance_cv: 0.11\n      entropy_ratio: 0.88\n      pruning_class: \"graded (gentle slope)\"\n      total_episodes_per_k: 500\n    result_rationale: >\n      Perceiver Resampler使用learned queries通过cross-attention聚合visual features，\n      每个query已经是信息聚合后的结果（类似Q-Former）。\n      与pixel-shuffle不同，Resampler没有hard spatial folding，所以不会catastrophic cliff。\n      与pure linear不同，cross-attention引入了non-trivial token依赖（query间有信息竞争），\n      所以不会immune。预期CV=0.11，低于X-VLA（0.151）因为Perceiver的learned queries\n      经过预训练已被优化为均匀覆盖visual information（类似于VQ-VAE的codebook均匀性）。\n      Pruning curve应显示gentle graded degradation——比OpenVLA MLP更温和\n      （因为每个query token本身就是信息聚合后的结果，冗余度更高），\n      但不immune（因为cross-attention的query specialization创建了partial dependencies）。\n      Baseline 42%较低是因为RoboFlamingo架构较旧（2023），在LIBERO上fine-tune效果\n      不如OpenVLA/SmolVLA等2024-2025架构。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Extended 6-Model Taxonomy (if C5 completes)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Connector | CV | Entropy | Pruning Class | k=0.5 SR |\n          |-------|-----------|-----|---------|---------------|----------|\n          | π0 | Pure linear | 0.038 | 0.959 | Immune | N/A (offline) |\n          | RoboFlamingo | Perceiver Resampler | 0.11 | 0.88 | Gentle graded | 15% |\n          | X-VLA | Linear+BART 12L | 0.151 | 0.614 | Threshold-graded | 42.6% |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP | 0.215 | 0.661 | Smooth graded | 37.4% |\n          | OFT | 3-layer MLP | — | 0.667 | (≈OpenVLA) | — |\n          | SmolVLA | Pixel-shuffle 16× | 0.314 | 0.952 | Catastrophic | 0% |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"6-model CV vs pruning tolerance scatter plot: x=CV, y=k at which SR drops below 50% of baseline. Perceiver Resampler填入CV=0.11位置，进一步验证CV作为continuous predictor的有效性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Perceiver Resampler（若完成）将taxonomy从3 connector families扩展到4：\n      pure linear（immune）→ learned cross-attention queries（gentle graded）→\n      linear+deep post-processing（threshold-graded）→ MLP（smooth graded）→\n      pixel-shuffle（catastrophic）。CV连续谱从0.038→0.11→0.151→0.215→0.314\n      更密集地验证了predictor的有效性。但即使C5未完成，\n      现有5 models × 3 families的evidence已足够支撑CoRL oral level投稿。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7907,"cache_read_input_tokens":45722,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7907},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d809dbe-96aa-4b7a-8b95-05649ec7187f","uuid":"076ffed0-5f8e-4fde-8539-d486a4935b17"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":397136,"duration_api_ms":398986,"num_turns":5,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Diagnose-then-Compress完整框架：CV诊断 + VTR通用压缩。\n  Claim 4升级为\"VTR provides universal compression across connector types\"——\n  pixel-shuffle从0%恢复到60%+，MLP projector在小M下也获益（VTC-only M=32 45%，M=64 52%，远超同压缩率hard pruning）。\n  L2-norm与random pruning在OpenVLA上全k-value一致（±3pp），确认MLP projector信息均匀分布，\n  跨模型公平比较无方法偏差。X-VLA seed44复现k=0.7 cliff在±6pp内，threshold-graded pattern稳健。\n  Analysis+Method双贡献均满强度，5模型taxonomy + 通用方法 = CoRL oral级别投稿。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C4-ext: OpenVLA VTC-only M-sweep (核心假设 #1)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only（冻结LLM backbone，仅训练22M cross-attention compressor）在OpenVLA上\n      将256个MLP-projected tokens压缩至32 queries。验证VTR对MLP projector connector的通用性。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.45\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.407\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.494\n      total_episodes: 500\n      compression_ratio: 0.875\n      tokens_in: 256\n      tokens_out: 32\n      kv_cache_reduction_pct: 87.5\n      per_task_sr_range: [0.22, 0.68]\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector tokens已经是individually meaningful的（CV=0.215，中等异质性），\n      cross-attention compressor不需要解决pixel-shuffle的空间纠缠问题，而是执行信息选择与聚合。\n      32个learned queries通过cross-attention可以覆盖256个输入token的关键信息。\n      VTC-only冻结LLM避免了M=128 full VTR的灾难性过拟合（0% SR），\n      但LLM backbone期望256 tokens的attention pattern被压缩到32时存在分布偏移。\n      45% SR = baseline 74%的61%保留率，远超同压缩级别的hard pruning\n      （k=0.3 keep 77 tokens = 20.6%；VTC M=32仅32 tokens却达45%）。\n      7B LLM backbone的表达能力为适应压缩后的token提供了更大的鲁棒性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: VTR Cross-Connector Universality\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Connector | M | Compression | VTC-only SR | Hard Pruning (同压缩率) | Gain |\n          |-------|-----------|---|-------------|-------------|------------------------|------|\n          | SmolVLA | pixel-shuffle | 32 | 75% | 60.1±1.3% | 0% (k=0.5) | +60.1pp |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP | 32 | 87.5% | 45.0% | ~8% (k=0.125 est.) | +37pp |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP | 64 | 75% | 52.0% | 20.6% (k=0.3) | +31.4pp |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"OpenVLA VTC-only M-curve: x=M (32/64/96), y=SR%. 对比虚线=hard pruning at equivalent k. 展示VTR在所有压缩率下均优于hard pruning。\"\n    analysis: >\n      VTC M=32在OpenVLA上以仅32 tokens达到45% SR，而random pruning保留128 tokens（4×更多）\n      才达到37.4%。这证明learned re-encoding不仅修复pixel-shuffle纠缠，\n      对MLP projector也能实现更高效的信息压缩。Claim 4可升级为：\n      VTR provides universal token compression across connector types，\n      ceiling取决于connector的信息结构——pixel-shuffle获益最大（0%→60%），\n      MLP projector获益次之但仍显著优于hard pruning。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=64（75%压缩）在OpenVLA上的评估。与SmolVLA VTC M=32（同为75%压缩）形成跨connector对比。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.52\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.476\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.563\n      total_episodes: 500\n      compression_ratio: 0.75\n      tokens_in: 256\n      tokens_out: 64\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=64保留25%的token容量（64/256），压缩率与SmolVLA VTC M=32相同（75%）。\n      相比M=32，64个queries覆盖256个input tokens的信息更完整，\n      LLM的attention pattern从256→64的分布偏移也更温和。\n      52% = baseline的70%保留率，对比random pruning k=0.3（keep 77 tokens，20.6%）\n      和k=0.5（keep 128 tokens，37.4%），VTC M=64以更少tokens（64 vs 128）\n      超出14.6pp。M=32→M=64的+7pp增益符合信息论预期——\n      MLP tokens信息分布相对均匀（CV=0.215），更多queries = 更少信息丢失。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      跨connector对比：SmolVLA VTC M=32 75%压缩=60.1%，OpenVLA VTC M=64 75%压缩=52%。\n      SmolVLA更高是因为re-encoding修复了pixel-shuffle纠缠（本质是损坏修复），\n      OpenVLA则是纯信息压缩（tokens已经可用，压缩后部分信息不可避免丢失）。\n      这种差异恰好支持connector-dependent VTR ceiling的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=96 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: >\n      VTC-only M=96（62.5%压缩）在OpenVLA上的评估。接近无压缩区间，测试VTR overhead。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.58\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.536\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.622\n      total_episodes: 500\n      compression_ratio: 0.625\n      tokens_in: 256\n      tokens_out: 96\n    result_rationale: >\n      96个queries保留37.5%的token容量。信息损失进一步降低，\n      LLM attention pattern的适应负担最小。58% = baseline的78%保留率。\n      对比SmolVLA M=96 VTC（54.5±3.2%），OpenVLA M=96 VTC略高，\n      因为MLP tokens本身信息结构更利于压缩（无空间纠缠需要修复）。\n      注意SmolVLA M=96存在统计确认的dip（p=0.034 vs M=64），\n      OpenVLA VTC-only可能不存在此现象——因为MLP tokens的均匀分布\n      使得M-curve更接近单调递增。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"OpenVLA VTC-only完整M-curve (M=32/64/96) + SmolVLA VTC M-curve叠加对比。展示两种connector的VTR效率特征差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA M-curve呈单调递增（38→52→58），而SmolVLA M-curve在M=96处有dip。\n      差异机制：SmolVLA re-encoding修复纠缠，M值影响不大（flat curve，所有M在±5pp内）；\n      OpenVLA re-encoding执行信息压缩，更多M=更多信息保留（monotonic）。\n      两种connector type展现不同的VTR机制，丰富Method贡献。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # D108: OpenVLA L2-norm pruning统一协议 (核心假设 #2)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm importance-based pruning（与X-VLA相同方法）在OpenVLA上k=0.95评估。\n      对比现有random pruning k=0.95=69.4%，验证pruning method不影响结论。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.68\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.638\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.719\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.95\n      tokens_kept: 243\n      tokens_removed: 13\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -1.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      仅移除13/256 tokens（5%），信息损失极小。L2-norm选择的\"least important\" tokens\n      与random选择几乎等价，因为MLP projector的3层GELU非线性混合使token L2 norms\n      分布相对均匀（CV=0.215）。在仅5%移除量下，无论哪13个token被移除，\n      剩余243个tokens的冗余足以补偿。68% vs random 69.4%的-1.4pp差异\n      在统计噪声范围内（500 episode的CI约±4pp）。\n      L2-norm可能略低是因为importance-based方法倾向于移除\"独特\"信息的tokens，\n      而random方法分散移除保留了更均匀的信息覆盖——但差异是noise-level。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: OpenVLA Pruning Method Comparison (L2-norm vs Random)\"\n        content: |\n          | k | Random SR | L2-norm SR | Δ (pp) | Within ±5pp? |\n          |---|-----------|------------|--------|--------------|\n          | 0.95 | 69.4% | 68.0% | -1.4 | ✓ |\n          | 0.90 | 62.0% | 60.0% | -2.0 | ✓ |\n          | 0.70 | 49.0% | 47.0% | -2.0 | ✓ |\n          | 0.50 | 37.4% | 35.5% | -1.9 | ✓ |\n          | 0.30 | 20.6% | 19.0% | -1.6 | ✓ |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"OpenVLA pruning curve overlay: x=k ratio, y=SR%. 实线=L2-norm, 虚线=random, shaded band=±5pp。两条曲线几乎完全重叠，证明pruning method对MLP projector无差异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      L2-norm与random在所有5个k值上一致（最大差异2.0pp << 5pp threshold），\n      确认OpenVLA的3-layer MLP projector信息分布足够均匀，\n      importance-based vs random pruning不构成公平比较的偏差。\n      这消除了D108中识别的pruning method discrepancy问题：\n      paper可以放心地跨模型比较pruning curves，因为pruning方法不改变结论。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.9评估。对比random k=0.9=62.0%。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.60\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.557\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.642\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.9\n      tokens_kept: 230\n      tokens_removed: 26\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除26/256 tokens（10%）。MLP projector的moderate CV（0.215）意味着\n      L2-norm最低的26个tokens确实携带略少的信息，但由于非线性混合，\n      每个token的信息量差异不大。60% vs random 62%的-2pp差异\n      反映了importance-based方法移除的tokens之间存在轻微的信息互补性：\n      L2-norm最低的tokens恰好覆盖了一些独特的局部特征信息，\n      集中移除它们比随机分散移除造成略多的信息空洞。\n      但效应极小（-2pp），完全在±5pp阈值内。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9处L2-norm与random差异-2pp，与k=0.95的-1.4pp一致——\n      随着移除比例增加差异略微增大但始终在noise level。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.7评估。对比random k=0.7=49.0%。中等压缩率。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.47\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.427\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.513\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.7\n      tokens_kept: 179\n      tokens_removed: 77\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除30%的tokens（77个）。MLP projector的非线性混合在此压缩率下\n      导致每个被移除的token约贡献1/256的全局信息。L2-norm选择的77个lowest-importance tokens\n      总信息量与random选择的77个tokens接近（因CV=0.215的均匀性）。\n      -2pp差异源于importance-based方法的selection bias：\n      L2-norm lowest的tokens倾向于集中在特定spatial或semantic区域，\n      而random方法天然均匀采样。但MLP projector的spatial mixing限制了这种bias的影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA的cliff point（97.6%→56.2%），但OpenVLA在此处只是smooth degradation。\n      L2-norm 47% vs random 49%确认：graded degradation class对pruning method不敏感。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.5评估。对比random k=0.5=37.4%。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.355\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.314\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.398\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.5\n      tokens_kept: 128\n      tokens_removed: 128\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -1.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除50%的tokens。半数token被移除后，剩余128个tokens的信息完整性取决于\n      被移除tokens是否覆盖了不可替代的信息。对于MLP projector，\n      每层GELU非线性混合使相邻tokens共享约40-60%的信息（基于已知的attention entropy 0.639），\n      因此50%移除约损失25-30%的独特信息。\n      L2-norm 35.5% vs random 37.4%的差异维持在~2pp——\n      即使在高压缩率下，MLP projector的信息均匀性仍使两种方法等价。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.5是SmolVLA的全灭点（0%），OpenVLA仍保持35.5%（L2-norm）/37.4%（random）。\n      这个对比直接展示了connector type而非pruning method决定compressibility。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: >\n      L2-norm pruning k=0.3评估。对比random k=0.3=20.6%。极端压缩率。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.19\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.158\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.227\n      total_episodes: 500\n      pruning_method: l2_norm_true_removal\n      k_ratio: 0.3\n      tokens_kept: 77\n      tokens_removed: 179\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -1.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除70%的tokens。仅保留77个tokens时信息损失严重但仍非零，\n      因为MLP projector的每个token都编码了全局信息的一部分。\n      19% vs random 20.6%的差异趋于收敛——在极端压缩率下，\n      无论选择哪些tokens保留，剩余信息量都接近一个下限。\n      L2-norm方法保留的77个highest-importance tokens与random 77个tokens\n      的信息覆盖度差异已被压缩到noise level（-1.6pp）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      5个k值完整L2-norm curve确认：OpenVLA (MLP projector) 的pruning行为\n      与pruning method无关（max |Δ| = 2.0pp << 5pp threshold）。\n      Paper可以统一报告Table 1的taxonomy，无需对pruning method加caveat。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # X-VLA seed replication (核心假设 #3)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA k=0.7 seed44 replication\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.7 L2-norm pruning的seed44复现评估。原seed42=56.2%。\n      验证threshold-graded cliff pattern的seed稳健性。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.52\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.476\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.563\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 44\n      k_ratio: 0.7\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -4.2\n      within_10pp_of_seed42: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA的cliff point——BART encoder的12层transformer mixing在此处\n      导致关键token依赖被打断。Cliff的精确位置受evaluation randomness影响：\n      不同seed意味着不同的episode初始状态和任务实例化。\n      原seed42的56.2%中，per-task SR极度不均（T1=2%, T4=28%, T8=0% vs T0=94%, T2=100%），\n      说明某些task处于cliff边缘。seed44可能将部分边缘task推向另一侧，\n      导致±5-8pp波动。52%落在[46, 66]范围内，\n      且cliff pattern本身（k=0.9 ~97% → k=0.7 ~52% → k=0.5 ~42%）的阶梯结构不变。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: X-VLA Pruning Seed Robustness\"\n        content: |\n          | k | seed42 SR | seed44 SR | Δ (pp) | Pattern |\n          |---|-----------|-----------|--------|---------|\n          | 0.9 | 97.6% | 96.0% | -1.6 | Immune ✓ |\n          | 0.7 | 56.2% | 52.0% | -4.2 | Cliff ✓ |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"X-VLA pruning curve with seed bars: x=k ratio, y=SR%. 两条曲线（seed42/44）在k≥0.9几乎重叠，k=0.7处分叉但均处于50-60%区间，确认cliff位置稳定。\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed44复现在±10pp内（52% vs 56.2%，Δ=-4.2pp），确认：\n      (1) k=0.7 cliff是BART encoder架构特性而非evaluation artifact；\n      (2) threshold-graded pattern稳健——任何seed下k=0.9→k=0.7的drop均为~40pp；\n      (3) CV=0.151正确预测了intermediate pruning behavior（k=0.7 SR ≈ OpenVLA k=0.7）。\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA k=0.9 seed44 replication\"\n    plan_id: c1_xvla_cliff_pattern\n    description: >\n      X-VLA k=0.9 L2-norm pruning的seed44复现。原seed42=97.6%。确认above-cliff区间稳定。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.96\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.939\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.974\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 44\n      k_ratio: 0.9\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -1.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9保留90%的tokens，远在cliff（k=0.7）之上。\n      BART encoder的token依赖在仅10%移除时不会被破坏——\n      12层transformer的信息冗余足以补偿少量token缺失。\n      96% vs 97.6%的-1.6pp差异完全在evaluation noise范围内\n      （500 episode下baseline k=1.0 = 99.2%，本身就有±1-2pp波动）。\n      Above-cliff区间对seed极不敏感。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      k=0.9 seed44=96% 确认threshold-graded model的\"robust zone\"跨seed稳定。\n      这与π0的immune behavior（所有k值均稳定）和SmolVLA的catastrophic cliff\n      （所有seed均0%）形成完美对比，三种pattern都是seed-robust的。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # OpenVLA random pruning seed replication (补充稳健性)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\"\n    plan_id: c3_mlp_projector_graceful_degradation\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7的seed43复现。原seed7=49.0%。验证graded degradation curve的seed稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.47\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.427\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.513\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 43\n      k_ratio: 0.7\n      pruning_method: random_true_removal\n      delta_vs_seed7_pp: -2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP projector的graded degradation是architecture-level property，\n      不依赖specific token selection（已由L2-norm ≈ random确认）。\n      seed43改变的是evaluation trajectory，不改变pruning pattern。\n      k=0.7保留179/256 tokens，MLP的3层GELU混合在此压缩率下\n      损失约30-35%的有效信息。47% vs 49%的-2pp差异\n      源于不同seed下task difficulty的微小变化\n      （per-task SR方差约±5-10pp为正常波动）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      seed43确认OpenVLA degradation curve的smooth monotonic pattern不受seed影响。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\"\n    plan_id: c3_mlp_projector_graceful_degradation\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5的seed43复现。原seed7=37.4%。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.36\n      wilson_ci_95_lower: 0.319\n      wilson_ci_95_upper: 0.403\n      total_episodes: 500\n      seed: 43\n      k_ratio: 0.5\n      pruning_method: random_true_removal\n      delta_vs_seed7_pp: -1.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.5移除128/256 tokens。半数信息丢失后，MLP projector仍维持36%的SR，\n      因为保留的128个tokens通过3层MLP的非线性混合保有足够的全局表征。\n      36% vs 37.4%的差异（-1.4pp）小于CI宽度（~4pp），完全在noise内。\n      graded degradation pattern在不同seed下高度一致。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      两个seed的OpenVLA k=0.5数据（37.4%, 36%）可计算mean±std用于paper，\n      增强报告的统计可信度。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # C5: Perceiver Resampler (bonus，可能不在deadline内完成)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo Perceiver Resampler baseline + pruning\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: >\n      RoboFlamingo（Perceiver Resampler connector）在LIBERO-Object上的baseline + pruning sweep。\n      添加第4种connector family（learnable cross-attention queries），扩展taxonomy。\n      注意：6天内完成fine-tune + 全sweep的可能性较低，属于bonus实验。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_sr: 0.42\n      k095_sr: 0.40\n      k09_sr: 0.36\n      k07_sr: 0.28\n      k05_sr: 0.15\n      k03_sr: 0.04\n      importance_cv: 0.11\n      entropy_ratio: 0.88\n      pruning_class: \"graded (gentle slope)\"\n      total_episodes_per_k: 500\n    result_rationale: >\n      Perceiver Resampler使用learned queries通过cross-attention聚合visual features，\n      每个query已经是信息聚合后的结果（类似Q-Former）。\n      与pixel-shuffle不同，Resampler没有hard spatial folding，所以不会catastrophic cliff。\n      与pure linear不同，cross-attention引入了non-trivial token依赖（query间有信息竞争），\n      所以不会immune。预期CV=0.11，低于X-VLA（0.151）因为Perceiver的learned queries\n      经过预训练已被优化为均匀覆盖visual information（类似于VQ-VAE的codebook均匀性）。\n      Pruning curve应显示gentle graded degradation——比OpenVLA MLP更温和\n      （因为每个query token本身就是信息聚合后的结果，冗余度更高），\n      但不immune（因为cross-attention的query specialization创建了partial dependencies）。\n      Baseline 42%较低是因为RoboFlamingo架构较旧（2023），在LIBERO上fine-tune效果\n      不如OpenVLA/SmolVLA等2024-2025架构。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Extended 6-Model Taxonomy (if C5 completes)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Connector | CV | Entropy | Pruning Class | k=0.5 SR |\n          |-------|-----------|-----|---------|---------------|----------|\n          | π0 | Pure linear | 0.038 | 0.959 | Immune | N/A (offline) |\n          | RoboFlamingo | Perceiver Resampler | 0.11 | 0.88 | Gentle graded | 15% |\n          | X-VLA | Linear+BART 12L | 0.151 | 0.614 | Threshold-graded | 42.6% |\n          | OpenVLA | 3-layer MLP | 0.215 | 0.661 | Smooth graded | 37.4% |\n          | OFT | 3-layer MLP | — | 0.667 | (≈OpenVLA) | — |\n          | SmolVLA | Pixel-shuffle 16× | 0.314 | 0.952 | Catastrophic | 0% |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"6-model CV vs pruning tolerance scatter plot: x=CV, y=k at which SR drops below 50% of baseline. Perceiver Resampler填入CV=0.11位置，进一步验证CV作为continuous predictor的有效性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Perceiver Resampler（若完成）将taxonomy从3 connector families扩展到4：\n      pure linear（immune）→ learned cross-attention queries（gentle graded）→\n      linear+deep post-processing（threshold-graded）→ MLP（smooth graded）→\n      pixel-shuffle（catastrophic）。CV连续谱从0.038→0.11→0.151→0.215→0.314\n      更密集地验证了predictor的有效性。但即使C5未完成，\n      现有5 models × 3 families的evidence已足够支撑CoRL oral level投稿。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3d809dbe-96aa-4b7a-8b95-05649ec7187f","total_cost_usd":0.855348,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41788,"cache_read_input_tokens":102706,"output_tokens":20577,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41788,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":20281,"cache_read_input_tokens":45722,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7907},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":28255,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028374999999999997,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":20577,"cacheReadInputTokens":102706,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41788,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8269730000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":